spice
* SPICE Netlist
* Components and Connections

V1 1 0 DC 0 ; Input voltage source vi, connected to net 1
R1 1 2 R ; Resistor R, between nets 1 and 2
D1 3 2 Dmodel ; Diode, anode at net 3, cathode at net 2
XOPAMP 0 2 3 OPAMP ; Op-Amp, non-inverting input at ground (0), inverting input at net 2, output at net 3
V2 3 0 DC 0 ; Output voltage source connection, net 3 to 0

.model Dmodel D    ; Diode model
.SUBCKT OPAMP 1 2 3 ; Op-Amp model (Non-inverting, Inverting, Output)
* Insert op-amp model details here
.ENDS

.END